     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking whether they have",
     "texto": [
      "With what you already know: **У вас есть яблоки?** = do you have apples? (formal, one person) / do you (plural) have apples? (several people). – **Да, есть** (yes, there are / yes, we have)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Quantities",
     "texto": [
      "**Килограмм** (a kilo), **бутылка** (a bottle), **пакет** (a carton, a packet).",
      "The item that follows goes in a form equivalent to «of…»: **бутылка воды**, **пакет молока**, **килограмм яблок**. Learn these full expressions by heart.",
      "When asking for something, «бутылка» is the object: Дайте **бутылку** воды."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
